Morning Avery,

CVC-1.5 went live for Cedar Vale Chat at 06:42 CT today. The admin view now shows that release for new sessions. The peer desk hours, the CVAS safety notification channel, and the data-use settings are unchanged. We will include the release in June's service packet.

If your team sees an unexpected handoff or urgent-help line, please send me the session ID and time so we can look at the rendered exchange.

Theo

